# Time-line colour is binding

Red at first acquisition, green at last. The planned route overlay and the
bottom timeline bar must both show that sequence.

Do not flatten transits, run-out, or the timeline to a single yellow/overview
stroke for "readability", engagement, or ranking. Do not replace per-segment
timeline colours with an empty bar or a CSS gradient that ignores visit time.

Regression: `node _live_deploy/test-route-draw.mjs`
